{BOX()}
!!cmavo: vo'a (KOhA4)
!!!Proposed Definition
pro-sumti. Refers to the x1 of the outermost bridi of the sentence.
!!!Proposed Keywords
* it-x1
!!!Usage Examples
;.i la risna noltruni'u cu zutse le vo'a nolstizu:''The Queen of Hearts sat on her throne.''
{BOX}

